gai6(){return"The \u201cShare my profile\u201d setting, off at first, publishes a read-only page on the Mirinu relay: the name you pick and, for each title of the chosen types, its name, year, poster, status, whether it is in your favorites and your rating out of 10, with totals and the day of the last update. The app updates it at most once an hour, when your library changes. It is the only data Mirinu keeps in the clear: anyone with the link can read it. Your personal notes, watch dates and devices are never in it. The link is drawn at random, the page is closed to search engines, and its posters come from TMDB's servers."},
gai8(){return"This sharing rests on your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). Stopping it withdraws that consent: the app erases the page from the relay as soon as it reaches it, and keeps trying while offline; someone who opened it may keep it for up to a minute in their browser. A page the app has not updated for 180 days is erased. The relay then keeps a fingerprint of the link, and nothing else, for 2 years so it cannot be used again."},
gaij(){return"Public profile"},
gaii(){return"If you share your profile, you choose what it shows and you are responsible for it. The display name must not mislead or hurt anyone. A profile reported to contact@mirinu.ch that breaks these terms may be removed."},
gahV(){return"Your public profile"},
gahU(){return"If you share your profile, stop sharing in the app (Share my profile, Stop sharing): the page is erased from the relay as soon as the app reaches it. Deleting your account from the app also stops sharing. Without the app, write to contact@mirinu.ch with the link. Otherwise, it is erased 180 days after its last update."},
ahW(a){return"The relay accepts one update per hour: the next one will go at "+a+"."},
gai0(){return"If you lose this device or the app's data, you can no longer stop sharing from the app: write to contact@mirinu.ch with the link. Otherwise, the page disappears 180 days after its last update."},
